From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|vatn|lang=non}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/vahtn/|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|n}}

# {{uncountable|lang=is}} [[water]] ([[H₂O]])
#: '''''Vatnið''' er mjög [[tær#Icelandic|tært]].''
#:: The '''water''' is very [[clear]].
# {{countable|lang=is}} [[lake]]
#: ''Á [[Arnarvatnsheiði]] er [[fjöldi]] '''vatna'''.''
#:: On ''Arnarvatnsheiði'' [there] is a multitude of '''lakes'''.

